# Authored cloth-vob smoke fixture. Run with WORLD=OLDWORLD.ZEN.
# OC_LOB_FLAG_SMALL zen 6367; four further cloth-vobs are within 40 m.
# Harbour sails/flags and Khorinis banners are baked worldmesh surfaces, so this
# fixture deliberately makes no claim about the requested harbour/city coverage.
seed 73013
cheat god
set time 12 0
overlay off
view full
cloth checkpoint world-load
cloth setup 6367 oldcamp-flags
cloth off
cloth wind calm
wait 12000
rec cloth-oldcamp-off
shot cloth-oldcamp-off-calm
wait 3000
cloth wind gust
wait 10000
shot cloth-oldcamp-off-gust
cloth checkpoint off-gust
stop

cloth wind calm
cloth on
wait 2000
cloth reset-stats
wait 10000
cloth checkpoint calm-10s
cloth verify anchors
rec cloth-oldcamp-on
shot cloth-oldcamp-on-calm
wait 3000
cloth wind gust
wait 10000
shot cloth-oldcamp-on-gust
cloth checkpoint gust
cloth shoot fireball
wait 2000
cloth verify fireball
cloth checkpoint after-fireball
shot cloth-oldcamp-after-fireball
cloth wind calm
wait 5000
cloth shoot arrow
wait 1500
cloth verify arrow
cloth verify anchors
cloth checkpoint after-arrow
shot cloth-oldcamp-after-arrow
stop

# Keep the camera on the actual flag while the physical hero crosses the radius.
cloth wind natural
cloth distance 3450
wait 2000
rec cloth-oldcamp-radius
shot cloth-radius-inside
cloth checkpoint radius-inside
cloth distance 3750
wait 1000
cloth distance 3995
wait 34
shot cloth-radius-before-exit
cloth checkpoint radius-before-exit
cloth distance 4005
wait 34
shot cloth-radius-after-exit
cloth checkpoint radius-after-exit
wait 1000
cloth distance 4500
wait 1000
cloth distance 4005
wait 34
shot cloth-radius-before-entry
cloth distance 3995
wait 34
shot cloth-radius-after-entry
cloth checkpoint radius-after-entry
wait 1000
cloth distance 3450
wait 3000
cloth verify anchors
cloth checkpoint final
stop
physics stats
